Package: rockbot
Version: 2.01.090
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libsdl2-2.0-0, libsdl2-image-2.0-0, libsdl2-mixer-2.0-0, libsdl2-ttf-2.0-0, libsdl2-gfx-1.0-0, hicolor-icon-theme
Maintainer: Juan Pablo Lozano <libredeb@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/protoman/rockbot
Description: NES-style Mega Man inspired action platformer
 Rockbot is an open-source SDL engine for classic NES action
 games, shipping Rockbot 1 and Rockbot 2. Fullscreen 720x720 and
 GamerCard controls for Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W and Hyperpixel 4.0.
 .
 This package includes the game engine and both campaigns.
 The map editor is not included.
